        "width": 760,
        "height": 150,
        "body": "London to New York along the Earth's surface (the **great-circle** distance) and the compass bearing to set out on. For midsummer's day in London: where the **sun** stands, when it **rises and sets**, and the **moon's** phase.",
        "fieldTypes": {}
      }
    },
